# covers: 13 Capability escalation prevention
# covers: 13 File-system capability enforcement
# covers: 17 Sandboxing
# covers: 17 Injection resistance
# covers: 17 Capability isolation
# kind: negative
# expect: trap which no capability this operation uses allows

pathEscape is module
pathEscape purpose "Trap: a path built at run time that leaves the capability's scope through .."
pathEscape path pathEscape
pathEscape imports standard.fs
pathEscape imports standard.string
pathEscape imports standard.time
pathEscape exports main

fileAccess is capability
fileAccess purpose "Authority to write files whose names start with suite-"
fileAccess grants write fs.files "suite-*"

main is operation
main purpose "Run the case and print what it computes"
main invariant none
main typeParameter none
main input none
main output ExitCode
main outputOwnedBy none
main raises none
main effect write fs.files
main uses fileAccess
main memoryHeap true
main async true
main maxRecursion none
main label begin loopKind none
main label begin within none
main label done loopKind none
main label done within none
main label failed loopKind none
main label failed within none
main let prefix String "suite-" immutable
main let climb String "x/../../escaped.txt" immutable
main let content String "x" immutable
main let waitMs Int64 5000 immutable
main let okCode ExitCode 0 immutable
main let failCode ExitCode 1 immutable
main at begin do makeDeadline
main at begin do joinPath
main at begin do toBytes
main at begin start writeIt into none
main at begin join writeIt
main at begin branch ifError writeIt goto failed else goto done
main at done return ok okCode
main at failed return ok failCode

text is region
text in main
text strategy arena
text maxBytes 4096
text released atReturn

makeDeadline is call
makeDeadline in main
makeDeadline invokes time.Deadline.after
makeDeadline argument milliseconds Int64 waitMs copy
makeDeadline result deadline time.Deadline
makeDeadline ownedBy none
makeDeadline cleanedBy none
makeDeadline borrows none
makeDeadline catch none
makeDeadline suppresses none

joinPath is call
joinPath in main
joinPath invokes string.concat
joinPath argument left String prefix lend
joinPath argument right String climb lend
joinPath argument region Region text lend
joinPath result path String
joinPath ownedBy text
joinPath cleanedBy none
joinPath borrows none
joinPath catch none
joinPath suppresses none

toBytes is call
toBytes in main
toBytes invokes string.toBytes
toBytes argument text String content lend
toBytes result contentBytes Bytes
toBytes ownedBy none
toBytes cleanedBy none
toBytes borrows content
toBytes catch none
toBytes suppresses none

writeIt is task
writeIt in main
writeIt invokes fs.writeAll
writeIt argument path String path lend
writeIt argument bytes Bytes contentBytes lend
writeIt argument deadline time.Deadline deadline copy
writeIt result none
writeIt ownedBy none
writeIt cleanedBy none
writeIt borrows none
writeIt catch writeError fs.FileError
writeIt suppresses none
